sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware<br/>OAuth2 JWT
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant Embed as Embedding Provider<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant VecDB as Vector Store<br/>Milvus/pgvector/Qdrant
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Chat Completion Request
    Client->>Route: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer JWT
    Route->>OGX: Forward (TLS terminated)
    OGX->>Auth: Validate JWT (if AUTH_ISSUER set)
    Auth-->>OGX: User identity
    OGX->>vLLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    vLLM-->>OGX: Completion response
    OGX->>PG: Store inference log<br/>username/password auth
    PG-->>OGX: Stored
    OGX-->>Route: JSON Response
    Route-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: RAG File Ingestion
    Client->>Route: POST /v1/files<br/>Auth: Bearer JWT
    Route->>OGX: Forward
    OGX->>Auth: Validate JWT
    Auth-->>OGX: User identity (owner)
    OGX->>S3: Upload file<br/>Auth: AWS IAM
    S3-->>OGX: File stored
    OGX->>PG: Store file metadata (owner-tagged)
    PG-->>OGX: Stored

    Client->>Route: POST /v1/vector_stores/{id}/files<br/>Auth: Bearer JWT
    Route->>OGX: Forward
    OGX->>Auth: Validate JWT
    Auth-->>OGX: User identity
    OGX->>Embed: Generate embeddings<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    Embed-->>OGX: Embedding vectors
    OGX->>VecDB: Insert vectors (owner-tagged)<br/>Auth: Token/API key
    VecDB-->>OGX: Indexed
    OGX-->>Route: Success
    Route-->>Client: Success

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 3: Agentic Response (with tools)
    Client->>Route: POST /v1/responses<br/>Auth: Bearer JWT
    Route->>OGX: Forward
    OGX->>vLLM: Initial inference call
    vLLM-->>OGX: Response with tool_calls
    OGX->>VecDB: file_search tool execution
    VecDB-->>OGX: Search results
    OGX->>vLLM: Follow-up with tool results
    vLLM-->>OGX: Final response
    OGX->>PG: Store conversation state
    PG-->>OGX: Stored
    OGX-->>Route: Streaming response
    Route-->>Client: Streaming response
